\f0\fs24 \cf0 Before you start, you will need to install Gurobi (an optimisation solver).\
\
Here is the instructions to install Gurobi and use it with R: \
\
https://sites.google.com/view/jessica-leung/home/teaching/using-gurobi-with-r-and-python\
\
